clinical note: The primary objective is to describe eosinophil infiltration in resected (early stage) NSCLC.

Secondary objectives are:

* to investigate the correlation of T-Eos and B-Eos in the aforementioned patient population;
* to investigate the correlation between T-Eos and overall \& disease-free survival;
* to investigate the localization of T-Eos (periphery vs. center of the tumor lesions). condition: non-small cell lung cancer

